* {{audio|ru|Ru-патрон.ogg}}

===Etymology 1===
{{word|ru|ine|ph₂tḗr}}
{{bor+|ru|de|Patrone}}. Omitting several steps, from {{der|ru|la|patrōnus}}, from {{der|ru|la|pater}}.

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|патро́н|adj=патро́нный|dim=патро́нчик}}

# [[cartridge]], [[shell]], or [[round]], consisting of the assembled bullet, casing, propellant, and primer
#: {{uxi|ru|[[боево́й]] [[патро́н]]|[[live]] [[cartridge]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[подно́счик]] [[патрон|патро́нов]]|[[ammunition]] [[carrier]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[холосто́й]] [[патро́н]]|[[blank]] [[cartridge]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[уче́бный]] [[патро́н]]|[[dummy]] [[cartridge]]}}
# {{lb|ru|mechanical engineering}} [[chuck]]
# [[lamp]] [[socket]]
# [[tailor]]'s [[pattern]]

